                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                            <a href="#"><img src="img/study Landing Page Optimization.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="Role Of Voice Search SEO" /></a><br>
                            <div class="cus-bullet">
                                <h3>TABLE OF CONTENT</h3>
                                <li><a href="#1">Understand the Fundamentals of Landing Pages</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#2">Major Features of a Landing Page</a></li>    
                                <li><a href="#3">Designing and Client Experience</a></li>  
                                <li><a href="#4">Copywriting</a></li>   
